---
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="border-b-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#F2F0EA] py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <SectionLabel index="01 // PHILOSOPHY" title="ABOUT RAIN07" />

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-stretch">
      <!-- Left Asymmetric Editorial Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#FFFFFF] p-8 md:p-12 shadow-hard flex flex-col justify-between space-y-8">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0057FF] uppercase tracking-widest block mb-4">
            // CORE PERSPECTIVE
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-[#111111]">
            "I DON'T JUST BUILD THE APPLICATION.<br />
            I UNDERSTAND WHAT RUNS IT."
          </h3>
        </div>

        <p class="font-mono text-sm md:text-base text-[#111111]/85 leading-relaxed">
          RAIN07 focuses on the intersection between web development and infrastructure — building websites and applications while understanding the servers, networking, deployment and systems behind them.
        </p>

        <div class="border-t-2 border-[#111111]/20 pt-6 font-mono text-xs text-[#111111]/70 leading-relaxed">
          From designing decoupled frontends in Astro to customizing high-scale WordPress & Laravel backends, all the way down to configuring Linux VPS kernels, MikroTik firewall rules, and Cloudflare Workers edge caching.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: System Tenets / Editorial Blocks -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#111111] text-[#F2F0EA] p-6 shadow-hard space-y-3">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#D9FF00] uppercase tracking-wider">
            PRINCIPLE 01 // PRODUCTION RESILIENCE
          </div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#F2F0EA]/90">
            A software application is only as viable as the server stack it sits upon. We eliminate single points of failure with proper reverse proxying, DNS failover, and automated monitoring.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#FFFFFF] text-[#111111] p-6 shadow-hard space-y-3">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0057FF] uppercase tracking-wider">
            PRINCIPLE 02 // MEASURED PERFORMANCE
          </div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#111111]/90">
            Performance isn't an afterthought. We optimize Time to First Byte (TTFB) with LiteSpeed and edge caching, and minimize client-side bundle size with Astro static generation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#0057FF] text-[#FFFFFF] p-6 shadow-hard space-y-3">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#FFFFFF] uppercase tracking-wider">
            PRINCIPLE 03 // FACTUAL ENGINEERING
          </div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFFF]/90">
            Every specification is grounded in real-world feasibility — whether planning server sizing, calculating electrical loads (UPS/RAB), or drafting network BOQs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
